    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6690" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">capsus</span></b> , i, m.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A wagon-body</i>, <i>coach-body</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Vitr.
				10, 14</span></i>; Fest. s. v. ploxinum, p. 230 Müll.: cf.
					<i><span class="en">Isid. Orig. 20, 12, 3</span></i>.
			—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>An enclosure for animals</i>, <i>a
			pen</i>, <i><span class="en">Vell. 1, 16, 2</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
